        "description": "__Height:__ 165cm\n\nA suspicious boy who loves tinkering with machines and inventing things. He swore to create an age of electricity with his admired [older brother](https://anilist.co/character/391469/), and painted his dreams in the \"20th Century Electric Catalog.\"\n\nBut when his brother and the catalog vanished, he gave up on his dream, and his timid and cowardly personality has become even more pronounced.",
